### 인증 토큰 발급 시나리오
### 목적: Rubric #01 콘텐츠 CRUD 검증 전에 accessToken을 얻기 위한 보조 파일입니다.
### 실행 순서:
### 1. backend를 실행합니다.
###    cd C:\Users\jaemy\Downloads\sceniK\backend
###    .\gradlew.bat bootRun
### 2. Signup with valid password를 먼저 실행합니다.
###    이미 가입된 이메일이면 중복 오류는 정상으로 보고 Login with valid credentials만 실행하거나 email/nickname을 바꿉니다.
### 3. Login with valid credentials 응답에서 accessToken을 복사합니다.
### 4. 복사한 token을 api-tests/content-crud-validation.http의 @accessToken 값에 붙여 넣습니다.
### 5. refresh/logout/OAuth 요청은 Rubric #01 CRUD 검증 필수 단계가 아니므로 필요한 경우에만 별도로 실행합니다.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

### Signup with valid password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "email": "demo-auth@scenik.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "Demo Auth"
}

### Expected 400: password shorter than 8 characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "email": "short-password@scenik.com",
  "password": "short",
  "nickname": "Short Password"
}

### Expected 409: duplicate email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "email": "demo-auth@scenik.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "Duplicate Demo"
}

### Login with valid credentials
# Copy accessToken and refreshToken from the response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "email": "demo-auth@scenik.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Expected 401: invalid credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "email": "demo-auth@scenik.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Google OAuth login start (open this URL in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/oauth/google

### Exchange the one-time code received at the frontend callback
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/oauth/exchange
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "code": "paste-one-time-oauth-code-here"
}
